  "announcement_title": "0.0.69 - 2026-10-16",
  "announcement_changelog": "Native archive publication for 0.0.68 was stopped after finding the regression\nbelow. This release also includes its Pasmo arithmetic and ca65 layout fixes.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Supplied ca65 linker layouts now skip absent segments, including their pinned\n  starts and alignment. Explicitly selecting an empty segment still reserves its\n  position, as ld65 does. The built-in NROM vector reservation is preserved.\n  ([#705](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/pull/705))",
  "announcement_github_body": "## Release Notes\n\nNative archive publication for 0.0.68 was stopped after finding the regression\nbelow. This release also includes its Pasmo arithmetic and ca65 layout fixes.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Supplied ca65 linker layouts now skip absent segments, including their pinned\n  starts and alignment. Explicitly selecting an empty segment still reserves its\n  position, as ld65 does. The built-in NROM vector reservation is preserved.\n  ([#705](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/pull/705))\n\n## Install asm198x 0.0.69\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.69/asm198x-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script\n\n```sh\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c \"irm https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.69/asm198x-installer.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew\n\n```sh\nbrew install asm198x/tap/asm198x\n```\n\n## Download asm198x 0.0.69\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [asm198x-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.69/asm198x-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.69/asm198x-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [asm198x-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.69/asm198x-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.69/asm198x-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [asm198x-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.69/asm198x-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.69/asm198x-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [asm198x-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.69/asm198x-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.69/asm198x-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [asm198x-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.69/asm198x-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.69/asm198x-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n",
